{% doc %}
  The "the talks" wordmark, V1 (the owner's pick, 11 Oct; st-fable qa/talks-ux/wordmark/V1-FINAL.md): Caveat 700 (OFL)
  outlined with the font's kerning, tracking -0.015em, "the" + 0.2 em + "talks", the -3deg lift baked in, no swash.
  One path, defined ONCE per page by the header (`as: 'def'`, a zero-size sprite) and drawn everywhere else with
  <use> (`as: 'use'`: the header link, the drawer and the talks hub title), so its 9 KB ships once. fill =
  currentColor (the ink comes from the parent's colour). Decorative: the parent carries the visually hidden name.
  Size rule: height 0.8377em of the font-size it replaces; width auto (aspect 3.489 : 1).

  @param {string} [as] - 'def' (the sprite, once, in st-header) or 'use' (default).

  @example
  {% render 'st-talks-wordmark', as: 'def' %}
  <a href="/blogs/the-talks"><span class="visually-hidden">the talks</span>{% render 'st-talks-wordmark' %}</a>
{% enddoc %}
